<DocsLayout title="API Versioning Strategy | Echophi Docs" description="How Echophi versions its Partner API and handles backward-compatible changes.">
  <h1>API versioning</h1>
  <p>
    The public Partner surface is <code>/api/external/v1</code>. Webhook endpoints pin{" "}
    <code>api_version: v1</code> (default) and receive <code>X-API-Version: v1</code> on deliveries.
  </p>
  <p>Breaking changes will ship under a new major path or version pin — existing v1 contracts stay stable.</p>
</DocsLayout>
